Digital marketing is the practice of promoting products, services, or brands through online channels and digital technologies. It encompasses a range of strategies, including search engine optimization (SEO), content marketing, social media marketing, email marketing, pay-per-click (PPC) advertising, and affiliate marketing. The goal is to reach and engage a target audience through digital platforms like websites, social media, search engines, and mobile apps. Digital marketing allows businesses to analyze customer behavior through data analytics and measure campaign performance in real-time. Its flexibility and cost-effectiveness make it a key strategy for building brand awareness and driving sales.

